*.log
logs/
*.tmp
*.bak
*.cache
*.swp
*.swo
*.orig
*.rej

# ─── Node (scripts/ 拉 npm 包时偶尔会用到) ─────────────
node_modules/
.npm/
.yarn/

# ─── 内部开发状态文档 (不上传, 避免开发过程泄漏) ────────
REVIEW.md
UPGRADE_PLAN*.md
*_PLAN_*.md
NOTES*.md
TODO*.md

# ── 2026-10-27 统一范式补全（与 techdou 仓 .gitignore 标准对齐）──

